values ('d8e9f0a1-2b3c-4d43-8a23-3e4f5a6b7c63', 'world-religions', 'World Religions', 'World Religions introduces students to major religious traditions, Indigenous and diasporic religious worlds, new religious movements, nonreligion, and cross-tradition themes through academic methods. Students study texts, rituals, ethics, material culture, social power, migration, media, and contemporary public life while learning that traditions are internally diverse, historically changing, and never reducible to a list of beliefs.');

