 "Affiliation and nonreligion"}, {"id": "c01e633a-f791-4eae-9c4d-e6cdb4552078", "type": "concept", "title": "Regional change"}, {"id": "99bf1c4c-0085-421f-9946-ee93b408f7dd", "type": "concept", "title": "Switching and fertility"}], "description": "Students learn to interpret global and regional data while noticing how census categories shape what is counted."}, {"id": "1ec33835-9989-45d8-90ce-129e7a66d1c8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Field observation and source ethics", "children": [{"id": "8951e3c3-32f6-4a98-afba-f5bd212ae8b5", "type": "concept", "title": "Observation protocol"}, {"id": "cac3597c-3bcd-4f1d-b2d6-a2796d0273f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Primary vs. secondary sources"}, {"id": "d8918ee3-8c4a-4db2-a012-e03788a5653f", "type": "concept", "title": "Reflexivity"}], "description": "Students practice respectful observation, accurate description, consent, source evaluation, and positionality."}, {"id": "a7f3f8d7-a017-4d89-a2a6-644751ffa91e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capstone synthesis", "children": [{"id": "78fc56e4-c819-456a-ba60-08ce1d4131fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Research question"}, {"id": "4529101d-b4b3-4707-b40c-e63d0cd22434", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence matrix"}, {"id": "794cccfc-bdc7-4c04-a51b-2f8bbb2b9f89", "type": "concept", "title": "Public presentation"}], "description": "Students bring theory, tradition, data, and case evidence together in a polished comparative project."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$wreljson$::jsonb,
